  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/chjAiJkT9Uqb1dmt7Hnxw21eZvUekpkO7tU--70NiJo.original.fullsize.png\"><br>Change in velocity,<br>$$<br>\\begin{array}{l}<br>|\\Delta \\overline{\\mathrm{v}}|=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{v}_{1}^{2}+\\mathrm{v}_{2}^{2}+2 \\mathrm{v}_{1} \\mathrm{v}_{2} \\cos (\\pi-\\theta)} \\\\<br>=2 \\mathrm{v} \\sin \\frac{\\theta}{2} \\quad\\left(\\because\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{1}\\right|=\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{v}}_{2}\\right|\\right)=\\mathrm{v} \\\\<br>=(2 \\times 10) \\times \\sin \\left(30^{\\circ}\\right)=2 \\times 10 \\times \\frac{1}{2} \\\\<br>=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}<br>\\end{array}<br>$$",
